                        Five times a day,<br>we are reminded<br>to <span class="story-em">reconnect.</span>
                    </h2>
                    <p class="story-subtext mt-6 reveal reveal-d2">
                        The world keeps moving. Prayer is the pause that gives meaning to the movement. AD-DIIN makes sure you never miss that moment.
                    </p>
                    <p class="story-subtext mt-3 reveal reveal-d3">
                        Make prayer part of your rhythm — not something you remember after the moment has passed.
                    </p>
